('Leaders in Homeopathic Therapeutics', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/Leaders_in_Homeopathic_Therapeutics-_EB_Nash-bc335-254042.jpg', 'E.B. Nash', 'B.Jain Publishers (India)', 'Homeopathic', '9788131901472', 'English', 516, '1st Edition', 490.0, 490, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'Pre-Order', 'This work contains Nash''s observations and facts he found to be correct and reliable. After reading through the writing of Hering, Dunham, Wells, Lippe, and all other stalwarts Nash came to a conclusion of certain symptoms which he found to be more reliable which he presented in this work. Considered to be one of the classical works of homeopathy, it is appreciated for the language and presentation of remedies by Nash. The drugs are presented in a wonderful but simplistic way beginning with the doctrine of signature or the sphere of action of the drug and later covering the characteristics of the drug without going into unnecessary details. The author additionally gives various references from other classical books which makes the reading interesting. Key features:- Includes examples of cases with the preion and also comparisons at various places in the book. The book covers over 200 remedies with their drug picture, comparisons, and references. Medicine''s explanation starts with the doctrine of signature or the sphere of action of the drug. To the point talk on each medicine, no extra unnecessary details. Show More'),
