('Delmar''s Manual of Laboratory and Diagnostic Tests', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/Delmars_Manual_of_Laboratory_and_Diagnos-Rick_Daniels-19720-286755.jpg', 'Rick Daniels', 'Delmar Pub.', 'Others Medical Book', '9781418020668', 'English', 1041, '2nd Edition, 2009', 9270.0, 8807, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'In Stock', 'Key Features • Three indices promote ease of use and quick access to information: list of tests by type, list of tests by body system, and a general alphabetical index that includes every test name and their synonyms. • Completely indexed and fully cross-referenced with test synonyms. • Three important chapters contain need-to-know information about laboratory and diagnostic testing, while introductory information is provided with each type of test. • Before-, during-, and after-test nursing considerations are listed for every test, reinforcing the concept that patient care is required beyond the test procedure. • Unique worldwide perspective provided by contributors from across North America provides a well-rounded knowledge base of information. • Rural, community, home, and international considerations included, as appropriate. Show More'),
('PC Das Beginners'' Applied English Grammar and Composition', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/PC_Das_Beginners_Applied_English_Grammar-P_C_Das-2c340-297517.jpg', 'P C Das', 'NCBA (India)', NULL, '9788173816499', 'English', 413, 'Reprint , 2025', 900.0, 900, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'In Stock', 'The heading of the Preface bears the testimony of a change in the publication of this edition of the book. I think, it would be pertinent to place on record for the convenience of my beloved students, teacher-colleagues and guardians that I was perturbed by the indifference shown to me by my previous publisher and the financial loss incurred by for years together. Then I approached New Central Book Agency (P) Ltd to publish the book afresh and they readily accepted the proposal. Further, this book is co-published by Katha-O-Kahini Prakashani Pvt. Ltd. Show More'),
('A Concise Textbook of Human Psychology', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/A_Concise_Textbook_of_Human_Psychology-Sarabjeet_Kaur-14fa3-163338.jpg', 'Sarabjeet Kaur', 'B. Jain Regular (India)', 'Department of Psychology', '9788131903339', 'English', 340, '1st Edition, 2020', 690.0, 656, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'In Stock', 'There was a dire need for a book on psychology that can quench the thirst of aspiring students to understand this subject of human psychology. A Concise Textbook on Human Psychology is a basic book to understand the subject of Psychology - The Science of Human Behaviour. Dr. Sarabjeet Kaur, MD in Psychiatry, has covered the subject very well with a simple easy to understand language, beginning with basic functionality of different parts of brain, subtly she enters the arena of human behaviour and covers aspect like Learning, Memory, Intelligence and Emotions while maintaining link from one chapter to another. The last chapter on Dreams and Dreaming is unique. DISTINGUISHING FEATURES: # Complete coverage on the subject with basic functionality of different parts of brain and understanding of human behaviour # Detailed explanation of various aspects of psychology # Discussion of different theories of psychology with their application to human behaviour Show More'),
('Blood Pressure : Etiology and Homeopathic Management', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/Blood_Pressure__Etiology_and_Homeopathic-Dr_NK_Banerjee-6a821-255011.jpg', 'Dr. N.K. Banerjee', 'B. Jain Regular (India)', 'Homeopathic', '9788131910757', 'English', 158, '1st edition, 2009', 198.0, 198, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'In Stock', 'DR.N.K.BANERJEE, M.SC.MHMS is the ex-principal of Bengal Allen Homeopathic Medical College and Hospital. He is also the ex-president of the Homoeopathic state faculty, in West Bengal, and vice president of the homoeo-pharmaceutical chemists association. He is the author of many books including; Blood Pressure • Practice of Medicine • Realistic Materia Medica • Gonorrhea and Syphilis. Hypertension being one of the most common problems of today''s lifestyle this book will be a valuable one for the practitioners who get many such patients. Key Features:- The chapter at the end ''Resume of the Therapeutics of Blood Pressure'', is found to be of great advantage to busy practitioners in acute cases. This book discusses all the aspects from etiology, signs and symptoms, effects on different organs The investigations required and management of hypertension or high blood pressure are also explained Deion of Homeopathic repertory and remedial treatment on the basis of symptomatology Show More'),
('Marketing Management', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/b0c1a2e12_166407.jpg', 'Philip Kotler , Keven Lane Keller', 'Pearson Education (India)', NULL, '9789332587403', 'English', 899, '15th Edition, 2021', 2071.0, 1967, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'In Stock', 'Marketing Management: Indian Cases is a casebook companion aimed to help readers understand the concepts of marketing in the Indian context. The booklet carries 23 contemporary cases which provide in-depth analysis of different marketing principles and theories as applied by various companies in India and Asia. This casebook will be useful for students pursuing MBA and PGDBM courses. HIGHLIGHTS Explore marketing mix with MTR Foods Understand customer value with India''s e-commerce space and Flipkart Delve into the world of Information System and data utilization with Starbucks and Amazon Learn to leverage corporate trust and technology strength in the B2B market with Zicom Comprehend marketer''s challenges and complexities with Facebook''s strategies in India and China. Mahindra Show More'),
