('Essentials of Dental Anatomy and Oral Histology', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/Essentials_of_Dental_Anatomy_and_Oral_Hi-Kabita_Chatterjee-5b6d8-250376.jpg', 'Kabita Chatterjee', 'Jaypee Brothers Medical Publisher (India)', 'Dental', '9789390595969', 'English', 258, '3rd Edition, 2021', 1590.0, 1590, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'Pre-Order', 'Essentials of Dental Anatomy and Oral Histology is a lucid, well-illustrated and simple text for the undergraduate dental students. The text includes detailed morphology of deciduous and permanent sets of dentition, occlusion, basic method of tooth carving, vasculature and innervations of orofacial region, maxillary sinus, basic general embryology, development of tooth, mechanism of shedding and eruption of tooth, detailed histology of enamel, dentin, pulp, cementum, alveolar bone, periodontal ligament, oral mucosa and salivary gland. The text contains considerable number of colored photographs, original photomicrographs, illustrations, tables and diagrams. This edition includes few relevant additions and questionnaires in each chapter. Show More'),
