('History Of Modern India', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/History_Of_Modern_India-Bipan_Chandra-6ca0d-150625.jpg', 'Bipan Chandra', 'Orient Blackswan (India)', 'Foreign Language Books: University', '9789390122554', 'English', 351, '1st Edition, 2009', 950.0, 950, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'Pre-Order', 'History of Modern India presents an authoritative overview of the historical period known as British India. It moves away from a largely political narrative to offer: •An explanation of conditions in eighteenth-century India that helped the British East India Company establish its rule. •Important insights into the primary aim of colonial rule: the economic exploitation of India through trade and investment. •A detailed account of the nationalist movement. •An introduction to significant freedom fighters. This comprehensive textbook is essential for students of history, and for readers interested in the history of modern India. Show More'),
