('Homoeopathic Emergency Therapeutics 120 Acute Disorders', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/Homoeopathic_Emergency_Therapeutics_120_-Dr_Mahendra_Singh-3c6eb-254333.jpg', 'Dr. Mahendra Singh', 'B.Jain Publishers (India)', 'Homeopathic', '9788131900529', 'English', 173, '4th Impression, 2018', 490.0, 490, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'Pre-Order', 'Homeopathic Emergency Therapeutics - 120 acute diseases compiled by Dr. Mahendra Singh. He has pinpointed his 40 years of vast experience in the form of keynotes to make it uncomplicated and straight forward for the physicians in practice. Key Features:- It is a concise book on the management of acute disorders. The author has concluded his vast experience to make this book a complete guide for the study of management disorders in Homoeopathy All diseases are arranged in an alphabetical order for easy reference. The book contains 120 common acute disorders which are seen in regular practice. The author has revealed the combination of medicines that he used in his practice for particular diseases. The book is compiled for the use of beginners in homeopathy and families who wish to utilize Homoeopathic medicines for ordinary ailments. Show More'),
('Bailey and Love''s Short Practice of Surgery (Set of Vols. 1, and 2)', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/Bailey_-_Professor_P_Ronan-aca29-333038.jpg', 'Professor P. Ronan , Professor Andrew W. Mccaskie', 'CBS Publishers and Distributors (India)', 'Foreign Language Books: Medical', '9781032301518', 'English', 1675, '28th Edition, 2023', 12886.0, 12886, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'Pre-Order', 'The 28th edition of Bailey and Love’s Short Practice of Surgery is the leading surgical resource for medical students and surgeons in training. It encompasses the basic principles of careful history taking, observation, deductive reasoning, technical knowledge and post-operative patient care to ensure safe surgical practice. Key features # Relevant - the content matches both undergraduate and post-graduate curriculae # Readable – features summary boxes of core knowledge throughout the text. The consistent layout and style of tables, graphics, and diagrams aids easy understanding of key concepts. Also includes algorithms to assist the reader in understanding patient care pathways # Current- highlights where major developments in surgical practice have occurred or are likely to transform surgical practice in the next decade # Contemporary – includes expanded coverage of paediatric surgery andof transplant surgery. Emphasizes the importance of the multidisciplinary team approach, together with patient engagement in difficult decision making. # Authoritative – every chapter has been revised by expert authors, and the most up to date content has been included in a familiar format # Digital Resources – Readers can access extra content via the dedicated Bailey and Love website which includes Questions and Answers, Expanded Content, Videos, Author interviews and more. Bailey and Love’s Short Practice of Surgery 28th editioncontinues to provide the essential knowledge required for surgical training. It remains a familiar friend, venerated by generations of medical students as well as surgeons young and old as a rite of passage and a repository of the core learning needed for clinical practice. Show More'),
