('Corporate Accounting', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/Corporate_Accounting-S_N_Maheshwari-75f77-332208.jpg', 'S N Maheshwari , Sharad K. Maheshwari , Suneel K Maheshwari', 'Vikas Publishing House (India)', 'Department of Accounting', '9789354535000', 'English', 1232, '1st Edition, 2022', 1060.0, 1060, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'Pre-Order', 'Corporate Accounting is a comprehensive textbook on accounting for different types of corporate bodies, in tune with the growing importance and accounting complexities of the corporate form of business. The book is divided into three convenient sections, each comprising independent chapters dealing with a particular aspect of corporate accounting. It deals exhaustively with the course requirements of students preparing for BCom, MCom, MBA and professional examinations conducted by different institutions, such as the Institute of Chartered Accountants of India (ICAI), the Indian Institute of Bankers (IIB), the Institute of Company Secretaries of India (ICSI) and the Institute of Cost Accountants of India (ICAI). Show More'),
('Mathematics for IIT-JEE Main and Advanced Volume 2', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/Mathematics_for_IIT_JEE_Main_and_Advance-ML_Khanna_-08ba6-325802.jpg', 'M.L. Khanna', 'S Chand & Co Ltd (India)', 'Department of Mathematics', '9789355014085', 'English', 1922, '1st Edition, 2023', 1798.0, 1798, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'Pre-Order', NULL),
('Cost Accounting', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/Cost_Accounting-M_N_Arora-2ce79-332214.jpeg', 'M N Arora , Priyanka Katyal', 'Vikas Publishing House (India)', 'Department of Accounting', '9789356744127', 'English', 600, NULL, 998.0, 998, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'Pre-Order', 'Year after year, this book has immensely helped students in their comprehension of the subject and scoring good marks in examination. It''s has been written specifically for the prescribed syllabus of cost accounting Paper of B. COM (Hons.), Semester IV, of University of Delhi, School of Open Learning and other central universities. Its basic features are the same as the mother book Cost Accounting: Principle and Practice which is a UGC- Recommended text for the many years. This book is bundled with all the teaching tools like learning objectives, summary of the chapter, key terms, and a a large number of questions for practice. The fifth edition is the updated version of the fourth edition and as per latest CBCS syllabus. Show More'),
('Inner Life of Animals, The: Surprising Observations of a Hidden World', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/Inner_Life_of_Animals_The_Surprising_Obs-Peter_Wohlleben-6ed70-335624.jpg', 'Peter Wohlleben', 'Vintage Books (India)', 'Veterinary and Animal Husbandry', '9781784705954', 'English', 282, '16 July 2018', 998.0, 998, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'Pre-Order', 'ROOSTERS THAT DECEIVE THEIR HENS? Mother deer that grieve? Horses that feel shame? Up until just a few years ago, such ideas would have sounded absurd, mere wishful thinking on the part of animal lovers who wanted to feel closer to their charges. I''ve been around animals all my life and I was one of those dreamers. Whether it was the chick in my parents'' garden that picked me out as its mum, the goat at our forest lodge that brightened our days with her contented bleating or the animals I met on my daily rounds of the woodland that I manage, I often wondered what was going on inside their heads. Show More'),
