('Animal Cell Culture: Principles And Practice', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/Animal_Cell_Culture_Principles_And_Pract-Shalini_Mani_-0a2ed-326666.jpg', 'Shalini Mani , Anil Kumar , Manisha Singh', 'Springer (India)', 'Veterinary and Animal Husbandry', NULL, 'English', NULL, '1st Published, 2023', 14473.0, 14473, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'Pre-Order', 'This introductory guide provides novice researchers and lab students with a thorough step-by-step approach to standard animal cell culture techniques. Coverage includes lab safety and best practices, sterility management, preparation, ethical considerations, and troubleshooting for common pain points. This is an up-to-date, indispensable handbook for early-career researchers and students, as well as established scientists in biotechnology, cell and developmental biology, pharmaceutical toxicology, cytogenetics, and more. Show More'),
