('Advanced Topics in Molecular Biology', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/Advanced_Topics_in_Molecular_Biology-A_Kumar-754d1-338211.jpg', 'A. Kumar , A.K. Srivastava', 'Horizon Press', 'Department of Zoology', '9781898486282', 'English', 160, '1st Edition, 2001', 13678.0, 13678, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'Pre-Order', 'This volume provides a comprehensive overview of advanced topics in molecular biology. Written in a user-friendly style, each chapter begins with an "at-a-glance" guide and an introduction which outlines the basic concepts in brief and offers clearer understanding of the subject matter. Advanced Topics in Molecular Biology is essential reading for molecular biologists wishing to further their knowledge in this rapidly changing field. Show More'),
