('A Textbook of Botany Volume - II', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/A_Textbook_of_Botany_Volume_II-S_N_Pandey-c1743-333147.jpg', 'S. N. Pandey , Prof. P. S. Trivedi , S P MISRA', 'Vikas Publishing House (India)', 'Department of Botany', '9789325994041', 'English', 736, '13th Edition, 2016', 1550.0, 1550, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'Pre-Order', 'During its 40 years of existence A Textbook of Botany, a multi-volume work, has established itself as a student-friendly book that explains the intricacies of botany in a very simple and interesting manner. The book was originally written for undergraduate students but over the years it has also proved helpful to postgraduates and those taking competitive examinations. The book has been revised extensively to include the latest discoveries and innovations in botany. Show More'),
('Advanced Differential Equations', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/Advanced_Differential_Equations-Dr_M_D_Raisinghania-c3155-332759.jpg', 'Dr. M. D. Raisinghania', 'S Chand Publishing (India)', 'Department of Mathematics', '9789352535897', 'English', 1528, '19th Edition, 2018', 1798.0, 1798, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'Pre-Order', 'This book has been designed to acquaint the students with advanced concepts of differential equations. Comprehensively written, it covers topics such as Boundary Value Problems and their Separation of Variables, Laplace Transforms with Applications, Fourier Transforms and their Applications, the Hankel Transform and its Applications and Calculus of Variations. While the textbook lucidly explains the theoretical concepts, it also presents the various methods and applications related to differential equations. Students of mathematics would find this book extremely useful as well as the aspirants of various competitive examinations. Show More'),
