('A Textbook of B.Sc. Mathematics Linear Algebra', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/A_Textbook_of_BSc_Mathematics_Linear_Alg-V_Venkateswara_Rao-c4e74-332737.jpg', 'V. Venkateswara Rao , N. Krishnamurthy , S. Anjaneya Sastry , S. Ranganatham , R. Bharavi Sharma , B. V. S. S. SARMA', 'S Chand Publishing (India)', 'Department of Mathematics', '9789352835270', 'English', 232, NULL, 590.0, 590, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'Pre-Order', 'This "Textbook of B.Sc Mathematics" for the students studying third year first semester in all universities of Telangana state was first published in the year 1988 and has undergone several editions and many reprints. Show More'),
('Allied Mathematics Vol-1', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/Allied_Mathematics_Vol_1-P_Duraipandian-4883b-332681.jpg', 'P. Duraipandian , S. Udayabaskaran', 'S Chand Publishing (India)', 'Department of Mathematics', '9789384319304', 'English', 364, NULL, 590.0, 590, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'Pre-Order', 'Part of a two-volume series, "Allied Mathematics Volume I" specifically cater to the students in the universities of Tamil Nadu. Succinctly written, it is designed in such a fashion to help in better understanding of students. Concepts have been explained, working rules to solve problems are given in specific subrules and the formulae involved in each solution are given in appropriate places of the solution. Also, Madras university questions have been used in the relevant places to illustrate the different concepts while chapter-end exercises with hints add ably to the practice quotient. Show More'),
('Blinding Polyphemus', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/Blinding_Polyphemus-Franco_Farinelli-e9048-342158.jpg', 'Franco Farinelli', 'Seagull Books (India)', 'Department of Geographical Science', '9780857423788', 'English', 192, 'Edition, 2018', 684.0, 684, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'Pre-Order', 'Today, we believe that the map is a copy of the Earth, without realizing that the opposite is true: in our culture the Earth has assumed the form of a map. In Blinding Polyphemus, Franco Farinelli elucidates the philosophical correlation between cultural evolution and shifting cartographies of modern society, giving readers an interdisciplinary study that attempts to understand and redefine the fundamental structures of cartography, architecture and the notion of “space. ” Following the lessons of nineteenth-century critical German geography, this is a manual of geography without any map. To indicate where things are means already responding, in implicit and unreflective ways, to prior questions about their nature. Blinding Polyphemus not only takes account of the present state of the Earth and of human geography, it redefines the principal models we possess for the description of the world: The map, above all, as well as the landscape, subject, place, city and space. Show More'),
('Blackie’s Dictionary of Chemistry', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/Blackies_Dictionary_of_Chemistry-Publishing_SChand-ee216-337998.jpg', NULL, 'S. Chand Publishing (India)', 'Department of Chemistry and Applied Chemistry', NULL, 'English', NULL, NULL, 680.0, 680, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'Pre-Order', NULL),
('Shiksha: My Experiments as an Education', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/Shiksha_My_Experiments_as_an_Education-Manish_Sisodia-1a417-341012.jpg', 'Manish Sisodia', 'Penguin Books (India)', 'Department of Education and Research', '9780143448525', 'English', 208, '1st Edition, 2019', 500.0, 500, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'Pre-Order', 'From schools of excellence to brilliant improvement in the board examinations and state-of-the-art facilities, government schools in Delhi rock. The implementation of innovative concepts like ''happiness curriculum'' and ''entrepreneurship mindset programme'' in Delhi government schools has brought about revolutionary change in the public school education system in the national capital of India. Show More'),
('Corporate Accounting - Semester 5', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/Corporate_Accounting-MC_Shukla-d4c7c-332226.jpg', 'M.C. Shukla , S. C. Gupta , T. C. Grewal', 'S Chand Publishing (India)', 'Department of Accounting', '9789352836468', 'English', 544, NULL, 1020.0, 1020, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'Pre-Order', 'Corporate accounting has been especially written to meet the requirements of B.Com. Students as per the choice based Credit System (CBCS) curriculum of University of Calcutta. It comprehensively presents the fundamental concepts of corporate accounting in an informative and systematic manner. table of Contents: Chapter 1: Introduction Chapter 2: Issue and Forfeiture of shares Chapter 3: Issue and redemption of Debentures Chapter 4: underwriting of shares and Debentures Chapter 5: Buy-back of shares and redemption of preference shares Chapter 6: Final Accounts of Joint stock company Chapter 7: Valuation of Goodwill Chapter 8: Valuation of shares Chapter 9: Amalgamation (combination) of Company and external reconstruction Chapter 10: Internal reconstruction of a Company. Show More'),
