('Financial Accounting II - Semester 3', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/Financial_Accounting_II-MC_Shukla-e6d87-332235.jpg', 'M.C. Shukla', 'S Chand Publishing (India)', 'Department of Finance', '9789352836642', 'English', 392, NULL, 780.0, 780, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'Pre-Order', 'Financial Accounting II has been especially written to meet the requirements of B.Com. Students as per the choice based Credit System (CBCS) curriculum of West Bengal state University. It comprehensively presents the fundamental concepts and accounting procedures in an informative and systematic manner. table of Contents: Chapter 1: Partnership Accounts Chapter 2: Dissolution of Partnership Firm Chapter 3: Conversion of Partnership Accounts into a limited company Chapter 4: Inland branch accounts Chapter 5: hire purchase, instalments and lease Chapter 6: Departmental accounts Chapter 7: Investment accounts. Show More'),
