('Foundations of Education', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/Foundations_of_Education-S_P_Chaube-a40ad-333336.jpg', 'S. P. Chaube , A. Chaube', 'Vikas Publishing House (India)', 'Department of Education and Research', '9788125911319', 'English', 372, '2nd Edition, 2003', 850.0, 850, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'Pre-Order', 'This book discusses in detail the psychological, philosophical and sociological foundations of education. The text highlights the basic postulates and social concepts of both Western and Indian schools of thought and its contribution to education. Many aspects of Indian philosophy and their role in strengthening the foundations of education are comprehensively covered. Maintaining the salient features of the earlier edition, this book is updated with the recent trends in education. Show More'),
