('Engineering Mathematics Volume - I', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/Engineering_Mathematics_Volume_I-Dr_M_V_S_S_N_Prasad-193d3-333787.jpg', 'Dr. M. V. S. S. N. Prasad , S. Ranganatham , B. Krishna Gandhi', 'S Chand Publishing (India)', 'Department of Mathematics', '9789352834099', 'English', 766, '1st EDition, 2018', 798.0, 798, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'Pre-Order', 'This is the Sixteenth edition of the book "Engineering Mathematics - I". The earlier editions have received positive response from the teachers and the students. This text book has been written strictly according to the latest revised syllabus - R16 (2016 - 2017) of First year (First Semester) B.Tech students of JNTU, Kakinada. Show More'),
