('A Textbook of B.Sc. Mathematics Real Analysis', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/A_Textbook_of_BSc_Mathematics_Real_Analy-V_Venkateswara_Rao-489ea-333921.jpg', 'V. Venkateswara Rao , N. Krishnamurthy , S. Anjaneya Sastry , S. Ranganatham , R. Bharavi Sharma , B. V. S. S. SARMA', 'S Chand Publishing (India)', 'Department of Mathematics', '9789355014412', 'English', 448, '1st Edition, 2022', 700.0, 700, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'Pre-Order', '"A Textbook of B.Sc. Mathematics [Real Analysis]" strictly covers the new curriculum for Course 4 (2nd year, 2nd semester) of universities in Andhra Pradesh. It covers Real Numbers, Sequences and Infinite Series with p-test, Cauchy''s nth root test or Root Test, D''-Alembert''s Test or Ratio Test, Alternating Series - Leibnitz Test. Show More'),
