('Pocket Medical Dictionary for Homeopaths', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/Pocket_Medical_Dictionary_for_Homeopaths-B_Jain_Publishers_-0b7a7-254982.jpg', 'B. Jain Publishers', 'B. Jain Large Print (India)', 'Homeopathic 3 Ratings  | No Review TK. 798', '9788131909294', 'English', 1040, '1st edition, 2007', 798.0, 798, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'Pre-Order', '''The Pocket Medical Dictionary for Homeopaths'' contains all the principal words and terminologies used in medicine and the collateral sciences during Hahnemann''s time. It also contains an extended appendix on varied topics, arteries, bones, muscles, micro-organisms which are pathogenic to man and animals to name a few. Appendix is also arranged in alphabetical order. It also includes physician''s and veterinary dose table both in the English and Metric measures based upon the U.S. Pharmacopoeia. Show More'),
