('Textbook Of Seed Science And Technology', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/Textbook_Of_Seed_Science_And_Technology-Padmavathi-7aab5-327773.jpg', 'Padmavathi , M. Prakash , S Ezhil Kumar', 'New India Publishing Agency', 'Others Engineering Book TK. 790', '9789390175321', 'English', 286, '1st Published, 2020', 790.0, 790, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'Pre-Order', 'A Text Book of Seed Science and Technology: Seed Science and Technology is the science of new discipline which deals with the principles and methods of production of Quality Seed and improving the quality of the seed by various seed enhancement techniques starting from sowing till the storage. The Importance of Seed Quality can be felt by the proverb "what are known as Seeds of Hope may turn into Seed of Frustration if Quality is not maintained". The Multidisciplinary development of the subject has necessitated an up to-date knowledge of this aspect of science in order to truly comprehense synthesis of the whole field of seed. The splendid growth of this science has catered to the development of related areas viz., Biology, Physiology and Biochemistry which has direct and indirect impact on Seed Science and Technology. The s of this book have been formulated to help the reader in acquiring the knowledge of Seed Technology starting from Seed Biology to seed Processing and care is taken to cover the basic and fundamental aspects of Seed Technology. It also includes the area of applied science and covers the area of seed legislation, law governing the seed production and marketing of the produced seeds. Show More'),
('Engaging the Hearts and Minds of All Your Employees: How to Ignite Passionate Performance for Better Business Results', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/995a900bb_118594.jpg', 'Lee J. Colan, Ph.D', 'McGraw-Hill (India)', 'Foreign Language Books: University TK. 798', '9780070139596', 'English', 244, '1st Edition, 2008', 798.0, 798, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'Pre-Order', NULL),
('Fundamentals of Accounting Financial Accounting', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/Fundamentals_of_Accounting_Financial_Acc-Ranganatham_Gangineni_-61e0e-332347.jpg', 'Ranganatham Gangineni , Venkataramanaiah Malepati', 'S Chand Publishing (India)', 'Department of Finance', '9789352835294', 'English', 168, NULL, 384.0, 384, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'Pre-Order', 'This book is designed as per the latest syllabus of B.Com Course of All Universities of Andhra Pradesh. Accounting is the language of business. So, it is very essential for the commerce graduate to have complete understanding of the process of accounting. The book is as per the new syllabus. In this book an effort has been made to give a complete understanding and linkage between various stages of accounting cycle to the student community at undergraduate level. Show More'),
('Practical Accounting Vol Il', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/Practical_Accounting_Vol_Il-RSN_Pillai_-7c1d2-332369.jpg', 'R.S.N. Pillai , S. Uma Devi , Bagavathi', 'S Chand Publishing (India)', 'Department of Accounting TK. 500', '9788121926652', 'English', 563, NULL, 500.0, 500, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'Pre-Order', '• Practical Accounting book is now available in two volume -Vol I contains 29 chapters and Vol II 17 Chapters. This Vol II contains 303 Practical Problems and their answers. • The problems are selected from the latest university question papers of 2003 and 2004. A special feature of the book is that the concepts have been elaborately explained step by step with minute details. Proper care has been taken to give correct solutions to all the problems given in this book. Show More'),
('Discrete Mathematics', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/Discrete_Mathematics-Seymour_Lipschutz-defa7-328473.jpg', 'Seymour Lipschutz , Marc Leepson , H. Patil', 'Mcgraw Hill Education (India)', 'Department of Mathematics', '9780070669123', 'English', NULL, '3rd Edition, 2009', 500.0, 500, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'Pre-Order', 'This text presents the subject within the purview of the course requirements, in agreement with the style followed by any Schaum’s title. With a presence of strong pedagogical features, the authors have explained all topics with a brief theoretical account to strengthen the understanding of Discrete Mathematics. Show More'),
('Enzymology and Enzyme Technology', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/Enzymology_and_Enzyme_Technology-S_M_Bhatt-acb15-333184.jpg', 'S M Bhatt', 'S Chand Publishing (India)', 'Department of Botany TK. 398', '9788121935845', 'English', 442, '1st Edition, 2014', 398.0, 398, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'Pre-Order', 'Enzyme : An Introduction • Enzyme Structure • Enzyme Specificity Show More'),
('Plant Anatomy and Embryology', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/Plant_Anatomy_and_Embryology-Pandey_SN-1a4a9-332479.jpg', 'Pandey S.N. , A. Chadha', 'Vikas Publishing House (India)', 'Agriculture TK. 1,190', '9788125902409', 'English', 476, NULL, 1190.0, 1190, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'Pre-Order', 'This textbook has two parts. Part One deals with Plant Anatomy which includes a wide range of topics starting from the fundamental unit, the cell, and covering details of the internet structure of root, stem, leaves, flowers, fruits and seeds, meristematic and permanent tissues, normal and abnormal secondary growth, etc. Topics such as Nodal Anatomy, Anatomy of Floral Parts, Fruit Wall and Seed Coat, Ecological Anatomy and Systematic Plant Anatomy will be of special interest to students. The text being simple and lucid compounded with natural and true-to-life illustrations, marks a special feature of the book. Part two deals with Plant Embryology and Palynology, and covers the structural life style, suitably divided into different chapters. Topics like Apomixis, Polyembryony, Experimental Embryology, Sexual Incompatibility, Classical and Applied Palynology, etc., will certainly feature awareness in the subject. The upgraded text matter studded with flow charts, comparative tables, and clear and lucid illustrations will be helpful in developing better understanding of the subject among the students. The book by virtue of its authoritative coverage, should be most suitable to undergraduate as well as postgraduate students of all Universities and also to those appearing for various competitive examinations such as CPMT, DME, DCS and IAS. Show More'),
('Botany for B.Sc. Students - Pteridophytes, Gymnosperms and Angiosperms', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/Botany_for_BSc_Students_Pteridophytes_Gy-B_P_Pandey-f2c3f-333090.jpg', 'B. P. Pandey', 'S Chand Publishing (India)', 'Department of Botany TK. 1,198', '9789355016683', 'English', 624, '1st Edition, 2023', 1198.0, 1198, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'Pre-Order', 'This textbook has been designed to meet the needs of B.Sc. Second Semester students of Botany as per Common Minimum Syllabus prescribed for all Uttarakhand State Universities and Colleges under the recommended National Education Policy 2020. This textbook comprehensively covers the theoretical and practical aspect of the paper Pteridophytes, Gymnosperms and Angiosperms. The theory part of the text introduces the students to develop an understanding of morphology, anatomy and reproduction of Pteridophytes, Gymnosperms and Angiosperms. It also discusses the origin of angiosperms along with their phylogeny and classification in details. Furthermore, taxonomy of plant families has been discussed in systematic manner. Practical part provides a strong conceptual understanding of the subject, it also helps in developing scientific outlook of the student. Show More'),
('Mathematics for B.Sc. Students -Differential Calculus | Integral Calculus', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/Mathematics_for_BSc_Students_Differentia-H_K_Dass-03047-332592.jpg', 'H K Dass , Dr. Rama Verma , Rajnish Verma', 'S Chand Publishing (India)', 'Department of Mathematics TK. 900', '9789355012784', 'English', 584, NULL, 900.0, 900, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'Pre-Order', 'This textbook has been designed to meet the needs of B.Sc. First Semester students of Mathematics as per Common Minimum Syllabus prescribed for all Uttar Pradesh State Universities and Colleges under the recommended National Education Policy 2020. A methodical text, which mirrors the flow of the units of the syllabus, has been created with a focus on developing mathematical skills in both Differential and Integral Calculus and enables the reader to possess an in-depth knowledge of the subjects. Apart from this, topics such as Convergence and Divergence of Series, Successive Differentiation, Partial Differentiation, Riemann Integral: Fundamental Theorems of Integral Calculus, Vector Differentiation and Integration have been well-explained. Show More'),
('5000 Solved Problems In Organic Chemistry', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/5000_Solved_Problems_In_Organic_Chemistr-Arun_Bahl-c3157-332941.jpg', 'Arun Bahl , B S Bahl', 'S Chand Publishing (India)', 'Department of Chemistry and Applied Chemistry TK. 1,700', '9789384319083', 'English', 1048, '1st Edition, 2014', 1700.0, 1700, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'Pre-Order', '5000 Solved Problems in Organic Chemistry is written for BSc students. This new book offers : 1. Fully solved problems for every topic. 2. Best selection of university examination questions. 3. Clear, concise and step-by-step answers to difficult problems. 4. Expert tips for mastering organic chemistry. 5. All you need to know to get better grades Show More'),
('Lattices and Boolean Algebras - First Concepts', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/Lattices_and_Boolean_Algebras_First_Conc-VK_Khanna-58593-332395.jpg', 'V.K. Khanna', 'Vikas Publishing House (India)', 'Department of Mathematics TK. 570', '9788125916536', 'English', 168, '2nd Edition, 2023', 570.0, 570, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'Pre-Order', 'This book is primarily designed for senior UG students wishing to pursue a course in Lattices/ Boolean Algebra, and those desirous of using lattice-theoretic concepts in their higher studies. Theoretical discussions amply illustrated by numerous examples and worked-out problems. Hints and solutions to select exercises added to the text as further help. Show More'),
('Botany For B.Sc. Students - Economic Botany and Plant Conservation - Low Priced Student''s Paperback', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/Botany_For_BSc_Students_Economic_Botany_-B_P_Pandey-8a935-333095.jpg', 'B. P. Pandey', 'S Chand Publishing (India)', 'Department of Botany TK. 550', '9789355016669', 'English', 248, '1st Edition, 2023', 550.0, 550, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'Pre-Order', 'This textbook has been designed to meet the needs of B.Sc. Second Semester students of Botany for the University of Jammu under the recommended National Education Policy 2020. This textbook comprehensively covers the theoretical and practical aspect of the paper Economic Botany and Plant Conservation. The theory part of the text introduces the students to understand the value of plants as sources of food, fodder, spices and drugs. The book also discusses the need to conserve the sustainable use of plants and design strategies for their effective conservation. Practical part has been presented systematically to help students achieve sound conceptual understanding and learn experimental procedures. Show More'),
