('Schaum''s Outline of Linear Algebra', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/Schaums_Outline_of_Linear_Algebra_-Seymour_Lipschutz-f6106-328474.jpg', 'Seymour Lipschutz , Marc Leepson', 'Mcgraw Hill Education (India)', 'Department of Mathematics TK. 1,238', '9780070605022', 'English', 432, '3rd Edition, 2017', 1238.0, 1238, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'Pre-Order', 'This third edition of the successful outline in linear algebra--which sold more than 400,000 copies in its past two editions--has been thoroughly updated to increase its applicability to the fields in which linear algebra is now essential: computer science, engineering, mathematics, physics, and quantitative analysis. Revised coverage includes new problems relevant to computer science and a revised chapter on linear equations. Show More'),
('An Introduction to Industrial Microbiology', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/An_Introduction_to_Industrial_Microbiolo-K_Sukesh-661ce-333178.jpg', 'K. Sukesh , P K Sivakumaar , M.M. Joe', 'S Chand Publishing (India)', 'Department of Zoology TK. 420', '9788121935197', 'English', 307, '1st Edition, 2010', 420.0, 420, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'Pre-Order', 'About the Book : • For the Graduate and Post Graduate students of different universities in Microbiology and Biotechnology. • This book is immensely helpful to under Graduate and Post Graduate students of Microbiology, Biotechnology and Allied Sciences. • The chapters are well conversed with Industrial Aspects in the production of Microbiology Inoculments in the field of Agriculture, Post Production Process, Fermentation Economics, IPR including some basic concepts of Metagenomics and Nanobiotechnology. Table of Content : Industrial Microbiology : Introduction| Industrial Fermentation| Bioreactors | Chemical Engineering Aspects Of Fermentation Technology| Organic Acids And Solvents | Microbial Polysaccharides, Amino Acids And Enzymes | Vitamins, Growth Factors And Hormones | Alcoholic Beverages And Other Microbial Food Products | Antibiotics And Vaccines| Agricultural Microbial inoculants: Industrial Production Aspects| Biofuels, Textile, Petroleum And Environmental Microbiology| Dairy And Food Microbiology| Fermentation-Post Production Techniques And The Future Show More'),
('Fundamental Concepts in Environmental Studies', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/Fundamental_Concepts_in_Environmental_St-_DD_Mishra-c38a7-333279.jpg', 'D.D Mishra', 'S Chand Publishing (India)', 'Environmental Engineering TK. 600', '9788121929370', 'English', 274, '1st Edition, 2010', 600.0, 600, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'Pre-Order', 'In addition to certain corrections, topics like Hydrologic Cycle, Air Pollution, Solar and Wind Energies are modified in the light of present requirement. Some new topics like Dissolved Oxygen, Biological Oxygen Demand, Chemical Oxygen Demand, Natural Geysers, Environmental Club, Green Accounting, Honey and Bee Keeping, Social Forestry are also introduced. With additional data, new topics and necessary diagrams, the book will be of immense use and more popular among students and readers. Show More'),
('Chemistry for Degree Students - B.Sc. (Honors) Semester I', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/Chemistry_for_Degree_Students-R_L_Madan-273e6-332929.jpg', 'R L Madan', 'S Chand Publishing (India)', 'Department of Chemistry and Applied Chemistry TK. 990', '9789355010360', 'English', 568, '1st Edition, 2021', 990.0, 990, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'Pre-Order', 'This textbook has been designed to meet the needs of B. Sc. (Honours) First Semester students of Chemistry as per the UGC Choice Based Credit System (CBCS). Maintaining the traditional approach to the subject, this textbook lucidly explains the basics of Inorganic and Physical Chemistry. Important topics such as atomic structure, periodicity of elements, chemical bonding and oxidation- reduction reactions, gaseous state, liquid state, solid state and ionic equilibrium are aptly discussed to give an overview of inorganic and physical chemistry. Laboratory work has also been included to help students achieve solid conceptual understanding and learn experimental procedures. Show More'),
('Practical Accounting Vol I', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/Practical_Accounting_Vol_I-RSN_Pillai_-86370-332368.jpg', 'R.S.N. Pillai , S. Uma Devi , Bagavathi', 'S Chand Publishing (India)', 'Department of Accounting TK. 700', '9788121926645', 'English', 887, NULL, 700.0, 700, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'Pre-Order', 'This textbook contains the solutions to Problems in Fundamental of Advanced Accounting Volume-1. The conventional Textbooks are mostly concerned with the exposition of prosaic theories and concepts and pay scant attention to their practical applications. This book is helpful to B.Com, M.Com., BBA, CA, ICWA, CS, MBA, etc. students. Show More'),
